{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Multitales Online",
    "steam_appid": 2439700,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439700/extras/ab2fd4e47191b9bc57433512d5da9c84.avif?t=1754556668\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439700/extras/e0ed2f44f47e5d755431a13cfbece54a.avif?t=1754556668\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if the fairy tale has come to an end, it doesn\u2019t mean its heroes have retired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious sorcerer\u2014unknown to any world until now\u2014unleashes an ancient ritual, tearing apart the established order. The balance between universes is shattered, the boundaries of reality begin to blur, and looming over everything is the <i>Fairypocalypse</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once again, the familiar heroes must shoulder a heavy burden: to restore what has been broken and stop the destructive rewriting of fairy tales. But this time, it\u2019s for real\u2014there are weapons, hordes of enemies, and a battle that could be their last. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an alternate story of fairy tale legends\u2014from Little Red Riding Hood to Alice in Wonderland and many others who are yet to take the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the story campaign or challenge your friends in arena battles. And remember: \u201chappily ever after\u201d is now just a memory. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh reimagining of familiar fairy tale characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark narrative hidden beneath a whimsical, lighthearted story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative Action \u2014 Defend either solo or with friends in lobbies of up to 4 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique cartoon art style crafted from scratch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven mode inspired by classic game mechanics</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439700/extras/ab2fd4e47191b9bc57433512d5da9c84.avif?t=1754556668\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439700/extras/e0ed2f44f47e5d755431a13cfbece54a.avif?t=1754556668\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if the fairy tale has come to an end, it doesn\u2019t mean its heroes have retired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious sorcerer\u2014unknown to any world until now\u2014unleashes an ancient ritual, tearing apart the established order. The balance between universes is shattered, the boundaries of reality begin to blur, and looming over everything is the <i>Fairypocalypse</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once again, the familiar heroes must shoulder a heavy burden: to restore what has been broken and stop the destructive rewriting of fairy tales. But this time, it\u2019s for real\u2014there are weapons, hordes of enemies, and a battle that could be their last. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an alternate story of fairy tale legends\u2014from Little Red Riding Hood to Alice in Wonderland and many others who are yet to take the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the story campaign or challenge your friends in arena battles. And remember: \u201chappily ever after\u201d is now just a memory. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh reimagining of familiar fairy tale characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark narrative hidden beneath a whimsical, lighthearted story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative Action \u2014 Defend either solo or with friends in lobbies of up to 4 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique cartoon art style crafted from scratch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven mode inspired by classic game mechanics</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Crazy competitive top-down shooter in the multiverse of fairy tales and legends.",
